        },
        {
          "id": "f2",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Precision Dental is a preferred provider for {{site:preferredFunds}}. Members of these funds may receive higher rebates on eligible treatments, depending on their level of cover."
        },
        {
          "id": "f3",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Patients with other private health funds are welcome too, and can still claim according to their level of cover. If you would like help understanding your policy before treatment, please ask us."
